_item_assets/steam/apps/1648760/extras/09330978fbc29f82825e46fb02093142.avif?t=1766336442\" width=640 height=86 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from various dive sites as you complete objectives such as charting the seafloor or carrying out scientific studies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate an oceanic research vessel to the exact location of your dive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Download scientific data and information on new points of interest from ocean buoys.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deploy your full ocean-depth rated ROV and complete scientific goals using the AI-assisted scanner, articulated arm, sensors, lander, and sediment corers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore trenches, survey wrecks, and study some of the ocean's most fascinating and unusual creatures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep track of your discoveries in the Gallery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete objectives to progress from trainee to Dive Master.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1648760/extras/5d9b68d4a7053b9aea4ae759763465c2.poster.avif?t=1766336442\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1648760/extras/5d9b68d4a7053b9aea4ae759763465c2.webm?t=1766336442\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1648760/extras/5d9b68d4a7053b9aea4ae759763465c2.mp4?t=1766336442\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >subROV: Underwater Discoveries is being developed in collaboration with the Bermuda Institute of Ocean Sciences and the Schmidt Ocean Institute, with funding from the European Union and partial funding from a National Science Foundation BIO-OCE grant.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>IMPORTANT INFORMATION FOR STEAM DECK OWNERS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >subROV has been certified for the Steam Deck, so it is fully playable and complies with several requirements set by Steam for the device.\u00a0The frame rate while exploring the seafloor <strong>often dips and stays in the 20s</strong>, though, and cloud saves have not been implemented yet. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you are thinking of buying subROV for the Deck exclusively, and generally can't stand low fps, we advise that you wishlist it for the time being.\u00a0 </p>","developers":["sqr3lab"],"dlc":[3144620],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1648760/header.jpg?t=1766336442","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1648760/512502/7c4b1821ce622706eff2b1a9039eb6e2c18cd4d3/1751013935/dash_av1.mpd?t=1668003290","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1648760/512502/7c4b1821ce622706eff2b1a9039eb6e2c18cd4d3/1751013935/dash_h264.mpd?t=1668003290","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1648760/512502/7c4b1821ce622706eff2b1a9039eb6e2c18cd4d3/1751013935/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1668003290","id":256915455,"name":"Main2022","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256915455/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1668003290"},{"dash_av1